        "description_heading": "Description",
        "description_body": "<p>Turn your favorite theme, hobby, or personal style into something you can enjoy every day with our <strong>Personalized Key Holder</strong>. More than just a practical place to keep your keys organized, this <strong>3D printed wall decor</strong> adds character and personality to your space. Each piece is made to order with customizable details such as color and name, creating a design that feels uniquely yours. Perfect for an entryway, office, garage, bedroom, workspace, or favorite corner, it combines everyday function with a fun decorative touch.</p><p>Whether you’re shopping for a birthday, Christmas, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, housewarming, anniversary, or simply looking for a thoughtful surprise, this <strong>custom key holder</strong> makes a unique gift they can actually use. Perfect for friends, family, coworkers, partners, or anyone who loves creative and personalized decor, it turns an everyday essential into something a little more special. Choose the design that fits their personality, add your custom details, and create a <strong>one-of-a-kind personalized gift</strong> made just for them.</p>",
        "open_description": false,
        "details_heading": "Product details",
        "details_text": "<p>This <strong>3D-printed wall key holder</strong>combines everyday function with personalized decor. Customize it with your preferred color and name to create a unique piece for a garage, office, entryway, or man cave. A practical and thoughtful choice for<strong>car lovers</strong>, it also makes a memorable personalized gift for birthdays, Father’s Day, Christmas, and other special occasions.</p>",
        "shipping_heading": "Shipping & returns",
        "shipping_text": "<p>Each item is made to order to help reduce waste and ensure careful attention to detail. Please allow <strong>7–9 business days </strong>for processing and production, as every piece is individually crafted and requires time to achieve the best quality. Once your order is ready and shipped, delivery typically takes <strong>3–7 business days</strong>, depending on your location and the shipping carrier.</p>",
        "personalization_heading": "Personalization",
        "personalization_info": "<p>Please complete all required personalization fields, such as <strong>Name, Color, Style, or other available options</strong>, and double-check your selections carefully before placing your order.</p><p>For personalized text, please use <strong>standard English letters and numbers only</strong>. Avoid special characters or emojis unless otherwise stated, as they may not display clearly on the finished product.</p><p>When selecting product characteristics or design options, please choose the options that best match your preferences and personalization details.</p><p>Please note that actual product colors may vary slightly from the images shown on our website due to lighting conditions during photography, screen settings, and differences between digital displays and the physical product.</p>",
